# Tables

## baskets
- id: uuid, primary key

- user_id: uuid | no foreign_key, belongs to users table in user_db.
- restaurant_id: uuid | no foreign_key, belongs to restaurants table in restaurant_db.

- created_at: timestamp
- updated_at: timestamp

## basket_items
- id: uuid, primary key

- basket_id: uuid, foreign key to baskets.id
- item_id: integer | no foreign_key, belongs to items table in restaurant_db.

- item_name: string
- quantity: integer
- price: decimal
- created_at: timestamp
- updated_at: timestamp

## orders
- id: uuid, primary key

- user_id: uuid | no foreign_key, belongs to users table in user_db.
- restaurant_id: uuid | no foreign_key, belongs to restaurants table in restaurant_db.
- courier_id: uuid | null | no foreign_key, belongs to couriers table in user_db.

- status: enum (pending, confirmed, preparing, ready_for_pickup, on_the_way, delivered, cancelled)
- total_price: decimal
- delivery_address: string
- created_at: timestamp
- updated_at: timestamp

## order_items
- id: uuid, primary key

- order_id: uuid, foreign key to orders.id
- item_id: integer | no foreign_key, belongs to items table in restaurant_db.

- item_name: string
- quantity: integer
- price: decimal
